WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:07.920
SCP-096 VS SCP-3521. We know looking at the&nbsp;
Shy Guy’s face is enough to drive him bananas,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:12.480
but can a chaotic deluge of bananas&nbsp;
from within finally kill the monster?

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:17.920
SCP-096 has proven to be almost unstoppable.&nbsp;
Thanks to its indestructible skeleton,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.520
the creature has been almost completely&nbsp;
destroyed in the past and still been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:25.120
able to pull itself back from the&nbsp;
brink with heightened regeneration.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:30.560
SCP-3521 is a pill that causes truly&nbsp;
deranged quantities of bananas to appear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:35.840
inside the victims’ stomach, killing them with&nbsp;
either ionizing radiation from the potassium or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:38.560
massive bodily trauma from all the bananas.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:44.800
Though personally, we think 096 could still&nbsp;
survive. Even if its stomach and torso burst open,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:50.400
spewing bananas everywhere, it would still likely&nbsp;
regenerate once the banana onslaught was done.

